    "answer": "3. 焚化爐燃燒含油物質，必須記錄 (海上經緯度)、時間、種類、數量及灰燼卸岸記錄於 垃圾紀錄簿。而使用之廢油(廢油處理)就必須記錄於油料記錄簿。 Incineration of oil residue (sludge) in incinerator from (W.O) tank should be recorded in the Oil Record Book. Incineration of oily garbage and used filters should be recorded in the Garbage Record Book",
