    "answer": "(a) 艙底水經15ppm equipment 排海時，除記錄打出數量及起迄之時間和目前所存數 量外，尚需記錄起迄之經緯度及船速並由負責操作輪機員簽名，尚需當時值班 船副簽名（例如：1200～1600須二副及大副之簽名），再由輪機長審核並同時 簽字確認。前述記錄完成後務必同時記入輪機日誌和甲板日誌。 While pumping out bilge water overboard through 15ppm equipment, the quantity, start and stop time of discharge and total retention of the tank(s), ship’s speed and position at start and end should be properly recorded. Each entry of discharging bilge water overboard in the oil record book should be signed by engineer in charge of the operation and on duty deck officer then signed by chief engineer. The details should also be recorded in the deck logbook and",
