    "answer": "21. 故障之原因。 Reasons for failure. 油水分離器設備的任何故障包括警報器及自動停止或船內再循環等，均應在油料紀錄簿 Code（F）中記錄。 Any failure of the oil filtering equipment covers also the alarm and automatic stopping devices, if applicable shall be noted in the Oil Record Book by using Code (F). 當油水分離器故障且船上無備品更換時，排海閥應關閉並用封環封住。 Failure of Oily Filtering Equipment, Oil Content Meter or stopping device and no spare parts",
