    "answer": "According to Discharge standard for water pollutants from ships (GB3552-2018), recently the China MSA has strengthened the inspection of Sewage Treatment Plant (STP) for calling ships, and will take and analyses the domestic sewage sample. If there is any non-compliance, the master and chief engineer need to go to the MSA to make relevant transcripts and a fine may be issued. In the worst case, the ship may be detained. Two of Company fleet vessels were inspected at CNNSS & CNNGB and against this Regulation as the MSA officers found that the storm valve of sewage was in OPEN position. Hereby reiterate and remind all ships to strictly manage the sewage on the ship. Please follow below instructions: 依據中國船舶水污染物排放控制標準的要求下(GB3552-2018)，近期中國 各港海事局已加強對於靠港船舶，檢查生活污水處理設備(STP)，並抽取 生活污水樣品帶回檢查，若有不符合規定者，船長及輪機長需到海事局製 作相關筆錄並將開罰，情節嚴重者可能導致扣船，同行船舶(馬士基)已被 開罰 10 萬人民幣 (公司兩艘屬輪分別於南沙及寧波接受檢查，在港期間， 因生活污水排海防浪閥(storm valve)未關閉，已違反中國船舶水污染物排 放控制標準)，在此重申並提醒各輪嚴格管控船上生活污水，以下注意事 項請遵照辦理：",
