    "answer": "1. When ship berthed at Chinese port, it is forbidden to discharge sewage. The three-way valve of sewage (or called “gate valve” in different type of ship) shall not be placed in discharging overboard position. During staying in China’s waters (extended 3 nautical miles from the coast), the ship’s three-way valve at the sewage treatment plant and the storm valve must be closed and locked. After leaving the China baselines 12 nautical miles, outside China waters, please follow normal discharge operation in accordance with IMO regulations. (Refer to Discharge Standard for Water Pollutants from Ships/attachment 5.1.1 & 5.1.2) 在港期間生活污水禁止排外，生活污水三向閥，絕不可繞過生活污水處 理設備擺在排海位置。屬輪於中國水域期間(領海基線 3 海里內)，生活 污水處理設備處的三通轉換閥 (部份船舶是 gate valve)，與生活污水的 排海防浪閥，需全部在關閉位置並上鎖。離開中國沿岸 12 海里後的其 他非中國水域，請依照 IMO 規定正常排放。(參閱中國船舶水污染物排 放控制標準/附件 5.1.1 以及 5.1.2)",
