    "answer": "3. Company has begun to carry out improvement plan for ships without sewage collection tanks or with insufficient capacity. Before the completion of the installation or modification operation, if any inspector inquiries regarding the sewage discharging, Crew must clearly understand the capacity of all tanks and explain to the inspectors as follows: the overboard valve of sewage is closed and locked. The sewage generated during the port stay will be treated by the STP then overflowed to the bilge well, then transferred to bilge tank. It will never leak into the port area. After leaving the port, it will be discharged through the OWS / 15ppm oil-water separator in accordance with the appropriate waters specified by IMO regulations. 公司已開始針對無生活污水收集櫃或容量不足船型進行改善規劃，於加 裝或改裝作業完成前，如遇檢查單位上船，船上同仁需清楚明白對於設 備船圖中的所有櫃子容量，並向官員解釋：船上的生活污水對外閥是關 上且上鎖，靠港期間產生的生活污水，經生活污水處理器處理後，過多 的會自行溢流(overflow)到 bilge well，然後使用 bilge transfer pump 打到 bilge tank，絕對不會洩漏至港區，待船舶離港後離開中國水域領海基線 12 海里之外，會經由 OWS/15ppm 油水分離器，依 IMO 法規規定的合 適水域排出。",
