    "answer": "Depending on the discharging method of the equipment on board of WAN HAI fleet, there are only (1) regulation 11.1.2(2.1&2.2) and (3) regulation11.1.3 The discharge of sewage into the sea will be prohibited, except when the ship has in operation an (1) approved sewage treatment plant or is (2) discharging comminuted and disinfected sewage using an approved system at a distance of more than three nautical miles from the nearest land; or is (3) discharging sewage which is not comminuted or disinfected at a distance of more than 12 nautical miles from the nearest land at not less than 4 knots. 根據萬海船上設備的排放方法，只有（1）條 11.1.2（2.1＆2.2）和（3）條 11.1.3 將禁止將生活污水排入海中，除非 當船舶在航行中（1）經批准的污水處理 設備或（2）離最近的陸地超過 3 海浬，使用許可的粉碎和消毒系統排放污水 時；或（3）與最近的陸地相距 12 海浬以上，以不小於 4 節的速度排放未粉 碎或消毒的生活污水。",
