    "answer": "一、適用範圍 Area of application 垃圾紀錄簿通常都是列為港口國管制及內外部稽核的重點檢查項目，而且時 常被找出不正確的紀錄而記下缺點，本指引已將船隊最常遭記入的缺點整理 羅列，此舉是為規範 船隊如何做好最正確 之垃圾紀錄簿記載， 以符合 MARPOL 公約規定及避免被記入任何有關於垃圾紀錄簿之缺點。 Garbage Record Book is regarded as a must-check item at PSC inspection, internal and external audit. Sometimes it will be raised deficiencies due to incorrect entries. This guideline has summarized the incorrect entries found among our Fleets and instructed how to make the most correct records as regulated by MARPOL, and to avoid any deficiencies regarding “Garbage Record Book”.",
