    "answer": "(六) 焚燒紀錄欄位，只有焚化爐已取得 IMO type approval certificate 的船舶(2000 年 1 月 1 日後安裝焚化爐於船上者)並實際使用者才須留有記錄。機艙實際 使用焚化爐所登記在油料紀錄簿中的數量(單位：立方米)，須同步登記在 垃圾紀錄簿上。 Shipboard incinerator shall possess IMO type approval certificate only applied to the incinerator installed onboard on or after 1st Jan. 2000. The incineration column should be recorded when the incinerator is using. Any incinerated quantity recorded in the “Oil Record Book” should be concurrently recorded in the “Garbage Record Book” (Unit: cubic meter)",
