    "answer": "(十二)依 MARPOL Annex V 公約規定，垃圾卸岸收據或證明應至保存於船上二 年，但為配合公司安全管理證書(SMC)外稽檢查時間(中檢每二年半，不長 於三年)，該垃圾收據或證明和垃圾紀錄簿均須保存於船上三年，即使船上 已使用新版本，但舊紀錄仍須繼續保存三年，不可提早丟棄。 According to the requirements of MARPOL Annex V, the receipts or certificates must be kept on board the ship with the “Garbage Record Book” for two years. However, for compliance with the inspection period of Safety management Certificate (SMC), every 2.5 years for intermediate audit and not longer than 3 years, the receipts or certificates must be kept on board the ship with the “Garbage Record Book” for 3 years. Old records should be kept on board for three years and not discarded even if new version has been adopted.",
