    "answer": "2. 滅火操演：檢查官員一般會要求於廚房(有個別針對排風管道之二氧化 碳滅火系統)/油漆間(有個別之灑水管路系統)/燃油加油站進行操演，前 往救火現場時應有兩人已穿著防火衣及配帶呼吸器，其他同仁則依據部 署表或者攜帶滅火器等消防器材/配備或者相應配合支援。緊急滅火泵 測試:於船艏甲板(最遠處)及駕駛台(最高處)各接一條救火皮龍並同時噴 灑，一般以水束超過一半船寬為認可壓力。廚師要瞭解廚房內滅火器、 通風設備及電路系統的使用。 Fire drill: Inspectors normally request the fire drill to be at Galley (focus on CO2 fire fighting system and galley ventilators) / Paint room (focus on the water sprinkling system) / bunker station. When arriving on scene, two of the fire fighting team should wear fireman’s outfit carrying SCBA, the other crew should carry fire fighting equipments according to muster list. Testing of efficiency of emergency fire pump is normally conducted from the main deck (as far as possible) and bridge (as high as possible) with connection of each one fire hose separately, spraying simultaneously to the extent of one half of the ship’s width, which will be recognized as acceptable water pressure. The chief cook should fully understand how to use fire fighting equipment, ventilators and the electric circuit system in the galley.",
