    "answer": "1. 33 CFR 151.2041/2045 執行關於壓艙水的管理規定，現行除於抵港前以 e-Mail 呈報相關壓艙水調整與更換記錄給 National Ballast Interchange Clearinghouse (NBIC) nbic@ballastreport.org 及美國公司/代理行壓艙水 報告外，負責操作壓艙水作業的所有船副須加以訓練並留下訓練紀錄， 以上所有相關均須詳加填寫並保存兩年備查，包括 USCG 及 California State Lands Commission(加州國土部)均可能登輪查驗。 According to 33 CFR 151.2041/2045 for the regulations of ballast water management, before arrival, please send the relevant Ballast water reporting form and exchange form to National Ballast Interchange Clearinghouse (NBIC) nbic@ballastreport.org and c.c to US office/agent as well. The officers executing the adjustment of ballast water operation also need to be trained and left with training records. All the relevant records must retain onboard for two years for inspection by USCG and California State Lands Commission.",
