    "answer": "2. 舷梯為登輪/離船之絕對管制重點，須保持兩人值班並始終(24Hrs)至少 一人”堅守崗位”並依 SSP 確實執行人員/行李之檢查/管制，USCG 特別 要求對碼頭工人必須核對含有照片之 ID 否則不予准許登輪。 Gangway watch for all in/out personnels and baggage check should be strictly controlled and keep two crews on duty, at least one to be stationed at gangway, according to the requirement of SSP. USCG especially emphasizes that all stevedores have to show their ID card, with photo attached, before boarding. No tender of such ID card should be prohibited from boarding the vessel.",
