    "answer": "6. 靠港期間，當值船員隨船舶吃水變化潮汐漲退，注意調整繫泊纜繩為天 經地義之事，但只限在船上這端調整，到碼頭上移換纜樁則嚴重侵犯帶 纜工人權益，即使是斷纜重帶或天氣轉劣須加強繫泊，均要經標準程序 取得工會許可或安排帶纜工人來後才可進行。 In port, it is a matter of course for the duty crew to adjust mooring lines along with the tides. But it is only acceptable at ship’s side, not the shore ship. Adjustment of mooring lines at shore side is against the lashers’ rights even when the mooring lines have been broken or weather turns bad. Please follow the standard procedures to get the approval from Union or stevedores beforehand.",
