    "answer": "（九） 長堤港綠旗方案(空氣污染) Long beach Green Flag program 自 2006.1.1 起，長堤港針對靠泊該港之船舶提出”Green Flag Incentive Program”，鼓勵船舶執行距離 Point Fermin 20 海浬範圍內不超過 12 節 之船速進入與離開，如該船公司所屬船泊(含租船) 能於全年度每一次 進/出均能符合要求，長堤港將就該船公司於該港之靠泊費用予以百分 之十五之減免。並自 2010.1.1 起，將執行距離放大為 Point Fermin 40 海 浬，只要全年度達成率達 90%，可獲得 25%的減免。請船長配合美國 代理行告知的 ETA 時間及要求，調整最佳靠泊時間。 With effective from 2006.1.1, port of Long Beach tendered the ”Green Flag Incentive Program” to encourage the shipowners to instruct their vessels to reduce speed under 12 knots in the 20 NMs range from the Point Fermin, please adjust your best ETB if there is no other special instruction from US Office. The dockage rate can therefore be saved at a maximum of 15% if do complied, and furthermore, since 2010.1.1, the dockage rate can be saved 25% if the 90% overall compliance rate for the speed reduction in the 40NMs range from the Point Fermin can be achieved.",
