    "answer": "1. 海事報告( Sea Protest/ Marine note of protest): 是指運輸過程中，船舶遭遇海損事故或惡劣天氣造成或可能造成船舶或貨物 損害，船長所簽署的聲明。該海事報告申述本船對不可抗力所造成的任何損 害不負任何責任，同時保留向有關方索賠和在適當的時間和地點延伸或補充 聲明的權利。 Sea Protest/ Marine note of protest is a declaration signed by the Master, to declare that when a vessel had encountered accidents or bad weather which caused or might cause damage to vessel or cargo during transportation. Sea Protest/ Marine note of protest states that the vessel is not responsible for any damage caused by force majeure, and reserves the right to claim compensation from the relevant parties and extend or supplement the declaration at an appropriate time and place.",
