    "answer": "海事報告經第一抵達港的航海機關或公證機構或船籍國駐當地使領館簽證 後，就成為保險人所必須取得的文件。船舶到達第一個港口的 24 小時內， 應把海事報告提交港務監督機構，在國外則提交本國駐當地領事館或其他有 關機構鑒證，或交公證機關鑒證。 Sea Protest/ Marine note of protest becomes a document that must be obtained by the insurer after endorsed by the maritime agency or notary agency of the first arrival port or the local embassy or consulate of the country of registry. Master must prepare a Note of Protest and upon arrival and/or never within 24 hours have it notarized at Notary Public. 海事報告之內容依法僅需記載事實情況(facts)即可，因為其具有法律上之有 效證據力，因此不宜在海事報告中陳述事故原因(cause of incident)、過失評 估(negligence judgement)或是責任歸屬(liability attribution)等內容，僅應簡潔 敘述事故狀態即可，切忌以形容詞描述事件發生情況或記下個人意見或感 受。 The contents of the sea protest should only writing the conditions of fact. Because it has an effective evident in the law, therefore not suitable to write the accident cause factor (cause of incident), the root causes (negligence judgement) or the responsibility proportion of the parties (liability attribution) and so on. The contents only should narrate the accident condition succinctly then prohibited that has the situation by the adjective description the event either takes down the personal opinion or the feeling.",
