    "answer": "2. 海事報告書之延續(Extended Marine note of protest) 由於「海事報告書」係在海上航行中或因滿載貨物，一時無法詳細徹底檢查， 僅能從表面觀察或憶測損害，必須等待靠碼頭或將貨物卸出部份或待進塢 後，方能找出損害之真實情況，因此乃將此損害情況，以「海事報告書之延 續」形式呈報，作為前述海事報告書之補充資料。 Since the damage cannot be inspected in detail at the first time, the contents of “Sea Protest/ Marine note of protest can only be observed or recalled from the surface. You must wait for berth or unload part of the cargo or go dock. Then you can find out the true situation of the damage. The Extended Marine note of protest can be used as supplementary information of Sea Protest/ Marine note of protest.",
