    "answer": "3. 事實陳述書(Statement of Fact) 之目的在使船東充分了解事故發生之經過，屬於公司內部文件，因此應將事 故發生之原因、過程和結果充分陳述之，對於船上處置該事件之方式亦應加 以說明始有助於事件原因之判定並藉以擬定將來改善之措施。報告製作完畢 應即交船公司參考保存，未經船東之允許，不得任意交給第三人，一般按日 期時間順序載明船舶作業之內容或所發生之事件，結語通常是再次確認所陳 述者與事實無誤即可。 The goal for Statement of fact are making the ship owner full understanding to the accident. It belongs to the company’s document, therefore it should fully state the accident’s reason, how to process and the result. The way of how the Master handles this event is also need to well state for these are helpful to know the real reason of cause as well as to draw a plan for improvement in the future. Soon as the report be completed hand over to the company to refer and keep, it shall not deliver to third party without ship owner permission. In general, the statement writing with date and time sequence about what is happen and how is ship operation about the case, then add word to confirm all the description is true in the last paragraph.",
