    "answer": "4. 碼 頭 作 業 工 人 造 成 損 害 報 告 (Stevedore Damage other than container Report) 船舶於港區作業時常見因碼頭作業工人之疏失而導致船體船上設備或貨物 受損者，此時應立即做成 Stevedore Damage Report 陳述損害事實及損害程 度，並交由碼頭作業工人代表簽收確認事實無誤，以玆佐證，以確保船方日 後得向碼頭作業工人獲得向傭船人請求賠償之權利。 The ship at harbor operation often found owing to stevedore neglect to cause ship equipment or cargo damage, at this condition the master has to produce a stevedore damage report at once, to state the damage fact and damage degree, deliver to foreman to signature and acknowledge the damage responsibility. The report will approve and hold the right to let the owner to claim to the stevedore company in future.",
