    "answer": "5. 船端簽收櫃損單之注意事項(Note of signing the Container and Equipment Interchange Receipt Damage Report) 貨櫃受損單為發現貨櫃外觀異常或損壞時，碼頭方為確保自身權益而給予船 方簽屬之文件。 The Container and Equipment Interchange Receipt Damage Report is a document which is issued by the terminal but sent to be counter-signed by the ship to protect their own rights and interests when the container was found to be abnormal or damaged.",
