    "answer": "6. 索賠函(CLAIM LETTER) 索賠函是在商務活動中當出現爭議糾紛後，受損方為了維護權益和解決問題 而用書面形式向違約一方提出索賠要求的信函。之所以寫索賠函，是想通過 協商來解決問題，因此寫索賠函前一定要分清是非責任，收集足夠證據，撰 寫時注意措辭和語氣的禮貌，促使事態朝有利於索賠的方向發展。 If there have a dispute happened during the commercial activity, a claim letter is a letter using for demand to the damaged party’s representative holding them responsible to protect rights and solve problems. The reason for writing the claim letter is to resolve the problem through negotiation. Therefore, before writing the claim letter, you must distinguish what the problem is. Collect sufficient evidence, and pay attention to the politeness of the wording and tone when writing, so as to promote the development of the situation in the direction of the claim.",
