    "answer": "Detail of Fact: The vessel mentioned above which was under my command sailed from port of HUANGPU on date 04/NOV/2020 to port of TAIPEI. And on her berthing TAIPEI for cargo operation, the stevedore’s ankle was injured on cat walk after No.2 hatch. The following description is the detail of the accident: 1130LT BOSUN informed duty officer that one stevedore was bruised on ankle due to serrated style grating fell off. 1131LT Master & C/O on scene immediately. Found the injured stevedore wound as following picture. Master talked to foremen to take the stevedore to hospital for wound treatment. 1155LT The injured stevedore left.",
