    "answer": "Dear Sir, Re：Collision With M.V.”ABC” at Keelung on 15/JUN/2020 I regret to inform you that while my command was berthing at the No.1 wharf at about 07:30 this morning the M.V.”ABC” drifted on the flood tide, striking on the port side and causing damage to my vessel “XYZ”. Circumstantial evidence indicates that the accident was attributable to the mishandling of their ship due to carelessness on their part, therefore, no liability will attach to my command. Will you take the matter up with the owners of the above named vessel to persuade them to accept liability for the damage and also request them to send their representatives to us together with yours as soon as possible, with a view to ascertaining the extent of the damage sustained? For your reference, I enclose a copy of my letter to the Master of the M.V.”ABC”. I trust you will attend promptly to the matter. Yours Faithfully,",
