    "text": "1. 離開 SECA 區域後，鍋爐才可開始換油。\nThe Aux. Boiler fuel system will be change from low sulphur MGO to VLSFO that need to depart from SECA.\n2. 轉換鍋爐燃油泵前 F.O.←→D.O.轉換閥至 F.O.位置。\nSwitch the F.O.←→D.O. change valve to F.O. position before oil pump suction.\n3. 將鍋爐控制面板上的選擇開關轉至 FO 位置，記錄換油開始時間及油表。\nTurn the fuel select switch on Boiler control panel to F.O. position; Record the fuel switch start time and\nflow meter.\n三、文書作業 Documentation\n1. 任何已交付予某船隻的船用燃料的燃料裝艙單，須備存於該船之上，並在所有合理時間可供查閱，備存\n期為該等船用燃料交付於該船隻當日後的 3 年。\nThe bunker delivery note (BDN) that relates to any marine fuel delivered to a vessel must be kept on board the\nvessel and be readily available for inspection at all reasonable times for a period of 3 years after the day on which\nthe marine fuel is delivered.\n2. 記錄船隻到達/開出的日期及時間。\nRecord the data & time of Arrival/Departure. The arrival in relation to a vessel means the moment when the vessel\nis first securely moored or anchored at a berth. The Departure in relation to a vessel is means the moment when\nthe vessel is untied from its berth. The Berth means a place in the waters of Hong Kong at which a vessel is not\nunderway.\n3. 將主/輔機和鍋爐使用 LSMGO 的時間統計,以及日用油柜中油量的消耗,和相關的靠離港動態信息或提報\n相關非人為所能控制之預期以外的事故。\nFinish the record in Engine Log Book of fuel switch act and declaration for ship’s moving development\ninformation. Even reported that due to an unexpected event beyond the Person’s control, the departure of vessel\nwas delayed from the expected time of departure to a later time (actual time of departure)\n4.換油的開始/結束時間、油量的消耗及船位(經緯度)需要記錄在輪機日誌。\nThe fuel change-over begin/finish time, consumption and ship position should be record in Engine Log Book.\n5. 換油完成的時間及船位(經緯度)也需要紀錄在航海日誌。\nThe fuel changeover finish time and ship position should be record in Ship’s Log Book.\n四、SECA 說明及各輪使用低硫 MGO 換油過程請見附件\n附件 14-6-1 硫排放管制區域\n附件 14-6-2 WH-10X 使用低硫燃油換油程序書\n附件 14-6-3 WH-17X 使用低硫燃油換油程序書\n附件 14-6-4 WH-23X 使用低硫燃油換油程序書\n附件 14-6-5 WH-27X 使用低硫燃油換油程序書\n附件 14-6-6 WH-28X 使用低硫燃油換油程序書\n附件 14-6-7 WH-31X 使用低硫燃油換油程序書\n附件 14-6-8 WH-32X 使用低硫燃油換油程序書\n附件 14-6-9 WH-33X 使用低硫燃油換油程序書\n附件 14-6-10 WH-35X 使用低硫燃油換油程序書(351-377)\n附件 14-6-11 WH-50-1 使用低硫燃油換油程序書"
