    "pdfPage": 138,
    "manualPage": "15-14",
    "chapterNo": 15,
    "chapter": "第十五章 海技部相關規範",
    "text": "（二） 此外，船上應自行填寫完成油料紀錄簿第 31, 32 及 33 項：其中，第 31\n項請參照 E/R bilge piping system；第 32 項請參照 I.O.P.P 證書；第 33\n項請參考 Capacity Plan。此為檢查重點，務必依規定填寫完成。\nBesides, the item number 31, 32 & 33 should be completed on board.\nFor number 31, please refer to E/R bilge piping system; for number 32,\nfollow the contents in I.O.P.P. certificate; for number 33, refer to Capacity\nPlan. This is a frequently inspection item which should be completed as per\nrequirements.\n五、油料記錄簿填寫說明及範例 ( UPDATE 2011.1.1 )\nthe instruction and sample for the log of Oil Record Book\nPart B -Entry Examples\n1. Code（C）殘油（油泥）之收集、與存量。\nUsage of Code C.11 : Collection of oil residues (sludge.)\n(a) 所需記載艙櫃之名稱請先參考IOPPC證書Form A Item 3.1上所列之艙櫃名稱(C\n11.1)、艙櫃容量(C 11.2)及總存留量(C 11.3)。Code C/殘油（油泥）之收集：應\n每七天於油料記錄簿用Code C 11記錄一次。\nWeekly inventory of oil residues (sludge) tanks (tank listed under item 3.1 in Supplement to\nthe IOPPC). (This means that the quantities must be recorded once a week.)\n.1 艙櫃之名稱 identity of tank(s)\n3\n.2 艙櫃容量 capacity of tank(s)............................................................…....... m\n3\n.3 總存留量 total quantity of retention....................................................…….. m\n3\n.4 人工收集污油量 quantity of residue collected by manual operation……........ m\n「當殘油（渣油）被轉駁移到殘油（渣油）艙時，由操作員進行的人工收集。」\n[Operator initiated manual collections where oil residue (sludge) is transferred into the oil\nresidue (sludge) holding tank(s).]\nIOPP證書Form A之Item 3.2及3.3上所列艙櫃，應使用Code I記錄。\nOther tanks listed in items 3.2 and 3.3 of Form A of the Supplement in the IOPP Certificate,\nwhich must be made entries into ORB by using Code I/additional operational procedures and\ngeneral remarks.\nExample : Weekly inventory ( IOPPC item 3.1 所載之 TANK )\nCode\nDate Item (number) Record of Operation/Signature of Officer In charge\n(letter)\nXX-Jan-2011 C 11.1 Xxxxxx xxxxx oil tank ( 殘油櫃名 依 item 3.1 所列)\nC 11.2 XXX.X M3 (總容量)\nC 11.3 XX.X M3 (殘油量)\n4/E xxx XX-Jan-2011 C/E xxx XX-Jan-2011"
