    "text": "overboard position.\n生活污水三向閥，絕不可繞過生活污水處理設備擺在排海位置。\n1.2 When the distance lies between 3 to 12 nautical miles from the nearest\nland, the sewage shall be discharged through STP.\n離岸 3 海里到 12 海里，必需經過 STP 才允許排放。\nThe discharge subject to meeting both conditions: (1) the sewage shall\nbe comminuted and disinfected (STP); and (2) discharge when the ship\nis en-route and proceeding at no less than 4 knots, the rate of discharge\nshall not exceed the maximum allowable rate corresponding to the ship\nspeed.\n但必須要有(1)使用設備打碎固形物和消毒後排放 (STP)；(2)船速不\n低於 4 節，且生活污水排放速率不超過相應船速下的最大速率。\n1.3 When the distance is more than 12 nautical miles from the nearest land,\ndischarging the sewage overboard directly is acceptable (including the\nsewage stored in sewage collection tank).\n離岸 12 海里以外，允許不經過 STP 排放 (包括生活污水儲存櫃的污\n水)。\nThe sewage shall be discharged when the ship is en-route and\nproceeding at no less than 4 knots, and the discharging rate shall not\nexceed the maximum allowable rate corresponding to the ship speed.\n船速不低於 4 節，且生活污水排放速率不超過相應船速下的最大速\n率。\n2. Before discharging the sewage, engineers should confirm with the duty\nofficer that the discharge position of sewage is beyond 12 nautical miles\nfrom the China baseline. The time and position (latitude and longitude) of\nopen and close of the three-way valve and storm valve should be recorded\nin the Sewage Operation Log which must be correct and checked in detail\non the chart. Before arriving at the destination port (before entering 12\nmiles from baselines of China’s waters), the shipboard should drain off all\nsewage as possible.\n機艙排放生活污水前須與駕駛台當值船副確認生活污水排放位置在中\n國臨海基線 12 海里以外，並記錄生活污水三向閥及排海防浪閥之開啟\n與關閉位置時間，在生活污水作業記錄簿(Sewage Operation Log)上的經\n緯度須正確並與海圖上的位置詳細對照。各輪抵目的港前(即進入中國\n水域領海基線 12 海里前)，盡可能排空船上生活污水。"
