    "chapterNo": 15,
    "chapter": "第十五章 海技部相關規範",
    "text": "3. Company has begun to carry out improvement plan for ships without\nsewage collection tanks or with insufficient capacity. Before the completion\nof the installation or modification operation, if any inspector inquiries\nregarding the sewage discharging, Crew must clearly understand the\ncapacity of all tanks and explain to the inspectors as follows: the overboard\nvalve of sewage is closed and locked. The sewage generated during the port\nstay will be treated by the STP then overflowed to the bilge well, then\ntransferred to bilge tank. It will never leak into the port area. After leaving\nthe port, it will be discharged through the OWS / 15ppm oil-water separator\nin accordance with the appropriate waters specified by IMO regulations.\n公司已開始針對無生活污水收集櫃或容量不足船型進行改善規劃，於加\n裝或改裝作業完成前，如遇檢查單位上船，船上同仁需清楚明白對於設\n備船圖中的所有櫃子容量，並向官員解釋：船上的生活污水對外閥是關\n上且上鎖，靠港期間產生的生活污水，經生活污水處理器處理後，過多\n的會自行溢流(overflow)到 bilge well，然後使用 bilge transfer pump 打到\nbilge tank，絕對不會洩漏至港區，待船舶離港後離開中國水域領海基線\n12 海里之外，會經由 OWS/15ppm 油水分離器，依 IMO 法規規定的合\n適水域排出。\n4. Always follow the PMS maintenance plan and ensure that sewage treatment\nplant is well maintained. (Company will modify PMS/Sewage maintenance\ncleaning intervals from 3 months to 1 month)\n務必遵照 PMS 保養計畫，確實對生活污水處理設備進行保養；(公司將\n修改 PMS/Sewage 保養清洗記錄，由原本的 3 個月改成 1 個月)\n5. Put STP in continuous operation status, and regularly sterilize on the\nreasonable basis. (For example, the MSA officers suggest there will be at\nleast 60L of sewage per person per day. Thus a 20-manned-vessel will\nproduce 1.2M3 of sewage per day. )\nSTP 放在持續運轉狀態，投藥量的計算方式請合理按照船上人數，定期\n投藥殺菌；(舉例某屬輪配置 20 人，海事局人員認為可按照每人每天最\n少 60L 計算，一天產生生活污水 1.2m3)\n6. Sewage treatment devices utiliting biological systems must have periodic\nmaintenance, microorganisms on aeration compartment (digestion tank) will\ndie and performance will be reduced, if it is not carefully maintained or if it\nallowed to get out of balance."
