    "text": "3. Operation procedure of sewage treatment plant/system/equipment：\n污水處理設施/系統/設備的操作程序：\n1. Operations should be adequately qualified personnel familiar with this type of\nequipment.\n操作人員應是熟悉此類設備且具有足夠資質的人員。\n2. Follow the specification/storage/filling instruction for disinfectant suggested by\nmaker.\n請遵循製造商建議的消毒劑的規格/儲存/填充說明。\n3. After preparation ready for operation, the select switch of discharge pump is at\n“Auto” position. Open inlet valves (stop or change over valve) let sewage flow\ninto S.T.P. the treated sewage through the water outlet valve (3) from contact\ntank and discharge overboard.\n準備運行就緒後，排放泵的選擇開關置於“自動”位置。 打開進水閥（停止\n或切換閥）\n，使污水流入 S.T.P. 處理後的污水通過出水閥（3）從接觸櫃排\n放到舷外。\n4. Follow the operation procedure, sample test procedure, check list for inspection,\n& maintenance items/ interval, the device will be keep in idea operation\ncondition.\n遵循操作程序，樣品測試程序，檢查清單以及維護項目/間隔，使設備保持\n理想的操作狀態。\n5. Do not turn off the power source for the aeration blower under normal\ncircumstances.\n在正常情況下，請勿關閉曝氣鼓風機的電源。\n6. Do not keep sewage in the tank for a long time.\n請勿將生活污水長時間存放在收集櫃中。\n7. Sludge removal should be pumped overboard (only into unrestricted waters)\nor ashore into a sewage system.\n污泥清除應泵出舷外（僅泵入非限制水域）或泵入岸上污水處理系統。\n8. Before inspecting inside the tank, make sure of the safety by checking gas\nconcentration.\n在檢查收集櫃內部之前，請檢測氣體濃度以確保安全。"
