    "text": "9. Restricted port/waters for black and/or gray water\n黑水/或灰水的受限制港口/水域\n9-1 UAILK port in black sea service:\n黑海 UAILK 港口服務：\nThe sewage overboard storm valve may need to close & lock at such\nports. 污水舷外防浪閥可能需要在這些港口關閉和鎖定。\n9-2 “No discharge zone” for 25 States of U.S.美國 25 個州的“禁排放區”\nProhibit discharge of any sewage, sewage sludge, gray water whether\nor not the discharge was treated into Coastal and ocean waters within\n12 miles of shore\n在美國 25 州相關港口經處理過之生活廢水在離岸 12 浬以內禁止排\n海(經處理後之生活廢水要貯存在 Sewage collect tank 內)\n10. The discharge of raw sewage through overboard direct valve into the sea\nwill be prohibited during in port & restricted water.\n在港口和禁排水域期間，禁止通過舷外閥直接將生活污水排入海中。\n11. The capacity of collect tank is not enough for collecting black and/or gray\nwater at restricted port/ water, it is necessary to feed back to PIC of Eng.\nand PIC of Maritech Division.\n收集櫃的容量不足以在受限的港口/水域處收集黑水和/或灰水時，有必\n要反應給工務部和海技部的 PIC。\n12. Any additional restricted ports/waters for black water and/or gray water in\nyour service route should be feed back to Maritech Division accordingly, in\norder to update the fleet administration operation manual in time.\n在航路中，任何其他對黑水和/或灰水受限制的港口/水域。應反饋給海\n技部，以便及時更新船隊管理操作手冊。\n13. A sample of operating procedure in next page for your reference. Each ship\nshould hang both of the sewage record book & itself summary SOP\n(standard operation procedure) on the hook beside the STP for normal\noperation & familiar training on board accordingly.\n下一頁中的操作步驟範例供參考。每艘船應將生活污水記錄簿及其摘要\nSOP（標準操作程序）都掛在 STP 旁，以利進行正常操作，並在船上進\n行熟悉訓練。\n14. If you have any amendment to Sewage Management in the future, please\nprovide to Maritech Division with your finding.\n如果將來對生活污水管理有進行任何修改，請向海技部提供見解。"
