    "text": "第六節 垃圾紀錄簿正確記錄\n一、適用範圍 Area of application\n垃圾紀錄簿通常都是列為港口國管制及內外部稽核的重點檢查項目，而且時\n常被找出不正確的紀錄而記下缺點，本指引已將船隊最常遭記入的缺點整理\n羅列，此舉是為規範 船隊如何做好最正確 之垃圾紀錄簿記載， 以符合\nMARPOL 公約規定及避免被記入任何有關於垃圾紀錄簿之缺點。\nGarbage Record Book is regarded as a must-check item at PSC inspection,\ninternal and external audit. Sometimes it will be raised deficiencies due to\nincorrect entries. This guideline has summarized the incorrect entries found\namong our Fleets and instructed how to make the most correct records as\nregulated by MARPOL, and to avoid any deficiencies regarding “Garbage\nRecord Book”.\n二、參考目標 References\nMARPOL Annex V 防止垃圾污染規則\n三、職權與責任 Authorities and responsibilities\n(一) 各輪大副負責垃圾紀錄簿之保管及記錄，並應將港口收受垃圾之單據或證\n明，分別建檔存查。\nThe Fleet Chief Officer is responsible for keeping and recording the “Garbage\nRecord Book”. The receipt or certificate received by the reception facilities\nshould be filed separately for inspection in future.\n(二) 各輪船長負責監督大副是否依規定執行及紀錄是否完備。\nThe Fleet Master is responsible for monitoring whether Chief Officer has\nimplemented and recorded the “Garbage Record Book” as required.\n四、作業指導 Guideline\n(一) 根據 MARPOL Annex V 中有關垃圾紀錄簿的修訂，目前將垃圾重新分\n類如下:\nPart (I)\n(A)Plastics 塑膠類\n(B)Food wastes 食物廢棄物\n(C)Domestic Wastes 生活廢棄物\n(D)Cooking Oil 烹調用油\n(E)Incinerator ashes 焚化灰燼\n(F)Operational wastes 作業廢棄物\n(G) Animal Carcass 動物屍體\n(H) Fishing Gear 漁具\n(I) E-waste 電子廢棄物\nPart (II)\n(J) Cargo residues(non-HME) 貨物殘餘物(對海洋環境無害物質)"
