    "chapter": "第十五章 海技部相關規範",
    "text": "四、 作業指導 Guideline\n（一） 美國航線，首重求生、滅火與緊急舵操演，各項防止污染的設備操作，\n及各項規定與紀錄是否齊備。\nUS lines service: The most important of all is the abandon ship drill, fire\ndrill, steering gear drill, the operations for all kinds of pollution prevention\nequipments, and relevant regulations and records well prepared as\nrequired.\n（二） 檢查必備文件 Required certificates for inspection\n1. 聯邦財務擔保證明：效期為三年，由公司向美國海岸防衛隊申辦\nFederal COFR (Certificate of Financial Responsibility): Three-year validity,\nmade application to USCG by company\n2. 加州財務擔保證明：效期為二年，由公司向加州漁業及狩獵部門申辦\nCalifornia COFR: Two-year validity, made application to California Department of Fish\nand Game by company\n3. 加州非油輪緊急應變計劃(簡稱 C-Plan)：無效期，由公司委託合格法人\n代為申辦\nCalifornia Non-tank vessel Contingency Plan (C-Plan): No time limit, made\napplication to Qualified Individual (QI) by company\n4. 船舶反應計劃(簡稱 VRP)：無效期，由公司委託合格法人代為申辦\nVessel Response Plan (VRP): No time limit, made application to Qualified\nIndividual (QI) by company\n5. 應急暨危險評估手冊(RRDA)或 ETAS：無效期，目前公司會與驗船協會\n簽約委託其為船舶穩定度計算顧問\nRapid Response Damage Assessment or ETAS: No time limit, contracted\nwith the Class as our consultant for calculation of ship’s bending moment,\nshearing force etc\n當船舶行駛美西航線(加州)以上文件缺一不可，而且必須在港口國檢查前\n船已備有正本，否則，將遭到罰款或是留置等處罰。\nWhen vessels call at ports of US service (California), all of the\nabove-mentioned 4 original certificates have to be available onboard before\ninspection. If not available, penalty or detention will be imposed accordingly.\n（三） 到港前檢查及 E-NOA/NOD (Electronic Notice of Arrival/Departure)\nInspection before arrival and E-NOA/NOD\n1. 依美國聯邦法規 Code of Federal Regulation (CFR)第 33 164.25 之規定於\n進入美國航行水域不超愈十二小時之前須進行包括舵機/電機/主機/內\n部通訊連絡與警報/儲存電瓶等之測試，此一測試一定要同時記錄於甲\n板與機艙之 logbook 中。"
