    "text": "ship’s lifesaving equipment and documents have been brought to muster\nstation. It is known that USCG now is only requesting the lowering down\nand heaving up of lifeboats, without crew inside the lifeboat. Inspectors\nrequest our crew to be able to speak his duty and his replacement in simple\nEnglish.\n2. 滅火操演：檢查官員一般會要求於廚房(有個別針對排風管道之二氧化\n碳滅火系統)/油漆間(有個別之灑水管路系統)/燃油加油站進行操演，前\n往救火現場時應有兩人已穿著防火衣及配帶呼吸器，其他同仁則依據部\n署表或者攜帶滅火器等消防器材/配備或者相應配合支援。緊急滅火泵\n測試:於船艏甲板(最遠處)及駕駛台(最高處)各接一條救火皮龍並同時噴\n灑，一般以水束超過一半船寬為認可壓力。廚師要瞭解廚房內滅火器、\n通風設備及電路系統的使用。\nFire drill: Inspectors normally request the fire drill to be at Galley (focus on\nCO2 fire fighting system and galley ventilators) / Paint room (focus on the\nwater sprinkling system) / bunker station. When arriving on scene, two of\nthe fire fighting team should wear fireman’s outfit carrying SCBA, the other\ncrew should carry fire fighting equipments according to muster list. Testing\nof efficiency of emergency fire pump is normally conducted from the main\ndeck (as far as possible) and bridge (as high as possible) with connection of\neach one fire hose separately, spraying simultaneously to the extent of one\nhalf of the ship’s width, which will be recognized as acceptable water\npressure. The chief cook should fully understand how to use fire fighting\nequipment, ventilators and the electric circuit system in the galley.\n3. 每一季(每不愈三個月)同時必須以電話與 CHGMS (Corbett and Holt,\nLLC/ Gallagher Marine Systems, Inc 進 行 Qualified Individual (QI)\nNotification Exercise，並記錄於 logbook 中。(應急電話表將另行提供)\nEvery quarter (less than three months), Master has to make phone call with\nCHGMS to conduct notification exercise and record it in the logbook.\n(Emergency notification number to be provided)\n4. 不宣佈的演習：加州防止漏油與應急辦公室 (OSPR)會在不事先宣佈的\n情況下選定船舶與其進行雙向演習，船長須於 30 分鐘內完成打電話給\n以下單位：合格法人，國家應急中心，加州緊急服務中心及漏油應急組\n織。\nUnannounced drill: California Office of Spill and Prevention Pollution will\nrandomly choose one vessel without prior notice to conduct two-way\nexercise. Master is responsible to make phone call within 30 minutes to all\nof the following parties: QI, NRC (National Response Center), OES"
