    "text": "(California Office of Emergency Service) and OSRO (Office Spill Response\nOrganization).\n5. 其他，請參考美西航線訓練光碟片，且請於抵港前加強實際操演，檢查\n官員特別著重於船員在各種演習狀況下之動作熟練狀況，及是否能以簡\n單英文講出本身的職責。\nBesides, please refer to CTP service training VCD and enhance actual\nemergency drill capabilities before arrival. Inspectors specifically like to\nfocus whether or not our crew is familiar with the correct procedures during\nwhich scope of the drills he should be taken, and is able to speak his duty in\nsimple English.\n（五） 壓艙水管理 Ballast water management\n1. 33 CFR 151.2041/2045 執行關於壓艙水的管理規定，現行除於抵港前以\ne-Mail 呈報相關壓艙水調整與更換記錄給 National Ballast Interchange\nClearinghouse (NBIC) nbic@ballastreport.org 及美國公司/代理行壓艙水\n報告外，負責操作壓艙水作業的所有船副須加以訓練並留下訓練紀錄，\n以上所有相關均須詳加填寫並保存兩年備查，包括 USCG 及 California\nState Lands Commission(加州國土部)均可能登輪查驗。\nAccording to 33 CFR 151.2041/2045 for the regulations of ballast water\nmanagement, before arrival, please send the relevant Ballast water reporting\nform and exchange form to National Ballast Interchange Clearinghouse\n(NBIC) nbic@ballastreport.org and c.c to US office/agent as well. The\nofficers executing the adjustment of ballast water operation also need to be\ntrained and left with training records. All the relevant records must retain\nonboard for two years for inspection by USCG and California State Lands\nCommission.\n2. 其他未盡注意事項，船員工作手冊之壓艙水管理中將有詳細說明，請另\n行參閱。\nOther matters not mentioned here will be specified in the Ballast water\nmanagement of FCSM, for your further guidance.\n（六） 廢水及污水管理 Graywater and sewage management\n1. 加州自 JAN/01/2006 起對所謂廢水”GRAY WATER”(包括洗澡水/廚房及\n一般清潔用水/洗衣等用水)及污水”SEWAGE WATER”有所謂”禁止排放\n區”(該指定區域延岸 3 海浬內之範圍)之規定，港口錨地及港內均屬，禁\n止排放經處理或未經處理之污水。如錨候及停港多時且收受 Tank 容量\n有限，則須及配合調整或管制，並不時宣導同仁相關認知及用水與節約\n等習慣。\nWith effect from 2006.1.1 in California, the undisposed “GRAY WATER”"
