    "text": "inspection and check have been confirmed by the foreman. It is known in\ngeneral that the fore/after 1.5 meters extension along the gangway, with\neffective wrap and lashing are acceptable. Not until the last stevedores leave\nthe vessel can the safety net be removed.\n4. 船上照明/工作環境/安全與警示標誌等均應充分考慮周全，於開工/解拉\n繩之前由工頭先行相關查驗，經通過後方才同意工人上船作業。\nAll the illumination/working environment/warning signs etc have to be well\nset up, checked and confirmed by the foreman before the unlashing work is\nstarted by stevedores.\n5. 在港內船舶一切裝卸任何物品之行為均屬碼頭裝卸工人之權益，故船上\n船員以任何一類動，機械吊伙食、卸包裹之行為，原則均係違法侵犯碼\n頭工人權益，包括用舷梯絞高放低之方式來搬運均不許可，規定違犯者\n將遭到罰款並另行加收裝卸費。\nIn port, all the loading/unloading of properties are the rights of stevedores.\nThe mechanic cranes cannot be used for provisions and parcels, even use\nthe adjustment of gangway for loading/unloading. The violators will be\nfined severely and additional discharge fee will be incurred.\n6. 靠港期間，當值船員隨船舶吃水變化潮汐漲退，注意調整繫泊纜繩為天\n經地義之事，但只限在船上這端調整，到碼頭上移換纜樁則嚴重侵犯帶\n纜工人權益，即使是斷纜重帶或天氣轉劣須加強繫泊，均要經標準程序\n取得工會許可或安排帶纜工人來後才可進行。\nIn port, it is a matter of course for the duty crew to adjust mooring lines\nalong with the tides. But it is only acceptable at ship’s side, not the shore\nship. Adjustment of mooring lines at shore side is against the lashers’ rights\neven when the mooring lines have been broken or weather turns bad. Please\nfollow the standard procedures to get the approval from Union or stevedores\nbeforehand.\n7. 船上貨櫃任何的 lashing/unlashing 未經裝卸工會授權人士同意，船員不\n得碰觸任何類似工作。\nAll the lashing/unlashing of containers should only be conducted and\ngranted by the authorized person of stevedore union. Our crew is not\nallowed to involve with such matter.\n（八） 加油及低硫柴油切換注意事項\nBunkering and low sulphur switchover procedure\n1. 若安排加油，須於抵達前 e-Mail info@chgms.com通知 CHGMS，並依\nISM 相關程序書於事前周詳準備與安排外，輪機員必須訓練能以簡單英\n語面對加油工作與緊急對話。"
