    "chapter": "第十五章 海技部相關規範",
    "text": "America (ECA) coastlines. Related change-over procedure has to be\nprepared accordingly.\n（九） 長堤港綠旗方案(空氣污染) Long beach Green Flag program\n自 2006.1.1 起，長堤港針對靠泊該港之船舶提出”Green Flag Incentive\nProgram”，鼓勵船舶執行距離 Point Fermin 20 海浬範圍內不超過 12 節\n之船速進入與離開，如該船公司所屬船泊(含租船) 能於全年度每一次\n進/出均能符合要求，長堤港將就該船公司於該港之靠泊費用予以百分\n之十五之減免。並自 2010.1.1 起，將執行距離放大為 Point Fermin 40 海\n浬，只要全年度達成率達 90%，可獲得 25%的減免。請船長配合美國\n代理行告知的 ETA 時間及要求，調整最佳靠泊時間。\nWith effective from 2006.1.1, port of Long Beach tendered the ”Green Flag\nIncentive Program” to encourage the shipowners to instruct their vessels to\nreduce speed under 12 knots in the 20 NMs range from the Point Fermin,\nplease adjust your best ETB if there is no other special instruction from US\nOffice. The dockage rate can therefore be saved at a maximum of 15% if do\ncomplied, and furthermore, since 2010.1.1, the dockage rate can be saved\n25% if the 90% overall compliance rate for the speed reduction in the\n40NMs range from the Point Fermin can be achieved.\n（十） 農業部 Department of Agriculture\n1. 美國農業部官員將於抵港後登輪檢查，非美國或被認可以外之水果/蔬\n菜等(含個人房間內)將被封存而於美國水域內禁止取用。\nUpon arrival, officers of Department of Agriculture will board the vessel for\ninspection. It is known that the unauthorized fruit/vegetable (including crew\ncabin) will be sealed and prohibited from using in the US waters.\n2. 廚餘集存的桶子須防漏且一定要有蓋，垃圾分類務必依 MARPOL Annex\nV 的規定，如其他類或一般垃圾中嚴禁混有任何廚餘殘留。塑膠類存量\n一定要配合船上每人使用量。\nFood waste must be stored in a bin with cover and no leaking according to\nMARPOL Annex V. The General bin and Others bin should not be mixed up\nwith food waste, for example. The quantity of the plastic bottles must match\nthe daily consumption of total crew remained onboard.\n3. 任何植物不得在船上種植；動物未通過檢疫不養在船上。\nNo plant is allowed to grow onboard; no animal is allowed to raise onboard\nif not passed the quarantine inspection.\n4. 甲板上(注意走道艙間)不可有乾枯菜葉或任意棄置的垃圾袋，垃圾分類\n務必依照規定，如有罰反規定將遭致罰款。\nNo dried vegetable or abandoned garbage bag is allowed on deck"
