    "chapter": "第十五章 海技部相關規範",
    "text": "(especially catwalk/crossover). Always follow the garbage disposal and\ncategorization regulations. Heavy fine will be imposed if so violated.\n（十一） 酒精檢測器 Alcohol test kit\n1. 自 2006 年 6 月 22 日起，美國海岸防衛隊規定在發生重大海上事故(SMI)\n後的兩小時內，必須針對事故的直接相關人員進行酒精檢測。酒精檢測\n器將由物料課供應上船。\nWith effective from 2006.6.22, USCG regulated that within 2 hours after\nSerious Marine Incident (SMI), alcohol testing should be done to relevant\npersons involved in SMI. Supply section will furnish the alcohol test kit to\nyour vessel.\n2. 至於毒品檢測，規定必須於重大海上事故發生後內 32 小時採樣檢測，\n可由美國海岸防衛隊/地方執法官員，或由接受過相關訓練的人員採集\n後送驗。\nAs to drug testing, it is regulated that within 32 hours after SMI the\nspecimens need to be collected by someone who has been qualified as\nmedical personnel or USCG/enforcing officers etc.\n3. 上述檢測儀器須列為產品合格清單中並備有證明。\nThe above-mentioned test kit has to be listed in the type-approved list with\nrelevant certificate.\n（十二） WNI 氣象導航\nWeather News Inc. Navigation recommendation\n1. 自 2006.1.1 起，萬海公司付費加入 WNI 氣象導航服務(舊名 Ocean\nRoute)，提供船長氣象導航的建議航向和及時的氣象資料。(注意：謹為\n建議航向而非強制遵循)\nWith effective from 2006.1.1, WHL paid to join WNI navigation service\n(ex-Ocean Route) for providing master’s with recommended routes and\ntimely weather info. (Note: it’s only recommended route, not compulsory to\nbe followed)\n2. 最遲在前往美國的最後一個港口，廠商將登輪協助完成船上 BRIDGE\n軟體之安裝，請船長及船副參照使用說明書，善加利用 WNI 所提供的\n氣象導航服務。\nNot later than the last port of call before departing for US, Maker will board\nthe vessel to install the software “Bridge”. Please master and deck officers\nrefer to the instruction manual and use the services provided by WNI well.\n3. 船長配合 WNI 要求，提供每日船位報及耗油情況。\nMaster is to cooperate with WNI to provide the daily position report and\nbunker consumption to WNI."
