    "chapter": "第十五章 海技部相關規範",
    "text": "（十三） 盜版光碟及非法軟體 Pirated CD and software\n美國是最注重智慧財產權的國家，如被海關查到盜版光碟及非法軟體，\n1 張光碟片將被處以 1 萬美元罰款，千萬勿以身試法。\nUSA is famous for her thinking highly of rights of intellectual property. If\neach pirated CD or software found and caught by the customs, each one will\nbe fined US$10,000. Please do not defy the law and cause trouble.\n（十四） 美簽 US visa\n1. 無辦理美國簽証同仁，不可下地以免遭觸犯法規。即使看水呎也須得到\n同意。\nCrew without US visa are prohibited from going ashore or strict penalty will\nbe imposed. Prior approval should be received even if just for landing on\nshore to check the draft mark.\n2. 無美簽同仁下地打電話亦不允許，可利用公司提供船上的公用電話向親\n人進行簡短問候(如美國代理行有提供)。\nCrew without US visa cannot land on the terminal to make phone call, but\ncan contact his family by public phone provided by company (if US agent\nhas so arranged for crew).\n（十五） 空氣汙染 Air pollution\n如煙囪廢氣被發現 1 小時內有連續 3 分鐘排煙，將可能導致巨額罰款。\nIt’s not allowed for the smoke stack emission from being emitted more than three (3)\nminutes in one hour. Heavy penalty will be imposed if so violated.\n（十六） 船舶一般符合計畫書 VGP Compliance plan\nVGP Final version 發布於 19 December 2008，規定自 19 June 2009 起最遲不晚於 19\nSep 2009 進入美國水域的船舶必須向美國環保署提出 NOI 意向書，VGP Final\nversion 將於 30 Jan 2014 正式生效，美線屬輪必須備有 SMFF(海難救助和海事消防\n服務提供商合約)及 OSRO(油污清理提供商合約)，方能符合規定。\nAccording to VGP Final version released on 19 December 2008, all vessels bound for\nUS waters must tender NOI (Notice of Intent) to US Environmental Protection Agency\nin the window between 19 June 2009 and 19 Sep 2009. Also, VGP Final version will be\nin force from 30 Jan 2014. To comply with VGP regulations, we need to prepare\ncontract of SMFF (salvage and marine fire fighting) and contract of OSRO (oil spill\nresponse organization) for US service vessels accordingly."
