    "text": "事實陳述書( Statement of fact)\nSTATEMENT OF FACT\nVessel Name‘s : WAN HAI XYZ Port : NANSHA\nFlag of Nationality : SINGAPORE Date : 21/NOV/2020\nIMO No. : 0000000 Master‘s Name : ABC\nPort of Registry : SINGAPORE Gross Tonnage : 27800\nOfficial Number : 000000 Port of Departure : HKHKG\nOwner : WAN HAI LINES (SINGAPORE) PTE. LTD.\nPort of Arrival : NANSHA\nPlace of the Fact Occurred: LAT: 22-33.4N LONG: 113-43.5E\nDate and Hour of Occurrence: 1830LT, 21/NOV/2020\nDetails of Fact\nThe above-mentioned vessel, under my command, laden with 21,102 M/T of\ngeneral cargo in containers, departed from HONG KONG KC-02 wharf at\n0400LT 21/NOV/2020 & proceeded to port of NANSHA with ETA 1630LT\n21/NOV/2020.\n21ST 1823LT The vessel steering course 338 degrees normally sailing in main\nchannel, checked the RADAR and AIS displayed on ECDIS, the\nMaster found the ship (Name: AAA) bearing 341DEG, distance\n1.9NM, course 028DEG, speed 1.3KTS, in the middle of main\nchannel went starboard side of main channel. So gave sharper\nlookout for her.\n1825LT Found M.V. AAA ready out of the main channel.\n1827LT Our ship course 343DEG, speed 15.1KTS, found the ship AAA\nswing to starboard and kept course 184DEG, speed 4.0KTS.\n1828LT The ship AAA bearing 350DEG, speed 4.5KTS, distance 0.6NM, no\nchanged course, continued proceeding to our ship, for preventing\ncollision and gave more wide berth, the Master gave an order\n“Hard Port” to let the ship went more port side."
