    "text": "事實陳述書( Statement of fact)\nSTATEMENT OF FACT\nVessel Name‘s : WAN HAI XYZ Port : HONG KONG\nFlag of Nationality : SINGAPORE Date : 22/MAR/2020\nIMO No. : 0000000 Master‘s Name : ABC\nPort of Registry : SINGAPORE Gross Tonnage : 47250\nOfficial Number : 000000 Port of Departure : PORT KLANG\nOwner : WAN HAI LINES (SINGAPORE) PTE. LTD.\nPort of Arrival : HONG KONG\nPlace of the Fact Occurred: 04-47.2N, 106-15.6E\nDate and Hour of Occurrence: 1630LT, 19/MAR/2020\nDetails of Fact\nThe above mentioned vessel, under my command, departed from PORT KLANG,\nMALAYSIA to HONG KONG, CHINA laden with 37,819 m/tons containerized\ngeneral cargo, packed in 2,233 vans, departure at 1224LT on 18/MAR/2020 ( port\nof PORT KLANG, MALAYSIA), estimated arrival time of HONG KONG,\nCHINA at 2100LT on 22/MAR/2020.\nDuring the voyage, at 1630LT, on 19/MAR/2020, Engine Cadet BBB was injured\nwhen he was engaged in maintenance work in engine room.\nDay 19/MAR/2020\n1500LT The patient BBB (Rank: E/C) and engine’s other crewmember carried\nout maintenance of fire bilge & ballast pump in engine room.\n1630LT During restored shaft & impeller and installed coupling’s lock ring,\nBBB left-hand was smashed by pump impeller due to the pump\nimpeller fell down, BBB suffered from left-hand middle finger\ninjury/bent, ring finger swollen and pain. 2/E informed the bridge\nimmediately.\n1635LT BBB went to hospital, second officer helped E/C disinfected and bound\nup his left-hand middle finger and ring finger.\n1650LT The wound was cleaned and bound up at 1650LT. The patient went to\nrest, and two 2/O took care of him alternately."
