    "text": "2. 海事報告書之延續範例\nSample of Extended Marine Note of Protest.\nOn this date, personally appeared to me Capt. ABC Master of M.V. ,\ngross tonnage 9,770.92 M/T, registered at Keelung, Taiwan, the Republic of\nChina, declared that further to the marine note of protest of 16/OCT/2020,\nendorsed by Chinese consul at Osaka on 20/OCT/2020, regarding her\nencountering heavy weather during voyage from Keelung to Kobe on\n13-14/OCT/2020, a new finding of the same case was found during her dry\ndocking at Kawasaki Dockyard, Kobe on 7/JUN-24/JUN 2020 as follows:\nThe bottom plating including keel plates in way of No.1 and No.2 double bottom\ntanks were found moderately set up varying from “1 to 4” in depth.\nI hereby enter this note of protest to serve and avail him if found necessary.\nAttested by Signature\nMaster of M.V.“ “ Signature"
