    "text": "3. 碼頭作業工人造成損害報告範例(亦可參見 ISM FM-0704-2)\nSamples of Stevedore Damage Report. (Also refer to ISM\nFM-0704-2)\nStevedore Damage Report\nM.V: WAN HAI XYZ Date:\n10/APR/2020\nTo: United Stevedoring Corporation Port: TAIPEI\nDear Sir,\nI, Captain ABC, the Master of M.V WAN HAI XYZ, action on behalf of my\nOwners WAN HAI LINES PTE.LTD., I regret to tell you that the following\ndamages sustained to my vessel during Loading/Discharging operation\nthrough the negligent work of your stevedores by means of crane, on\n00:48LT 10/APR/2020 at TAIPEI port TPCT berth #N3.\nThe damages were as follows:\n1. Radar mast post: Dia 17cm X L 500cm X 1 set\n2. Radar mast stay: Dia 12cm X L232cm X2 sets\n3. Radar antenna post: Dia 17cm X L 182cm X 1 set\n4. Fitting of GPS antenna X2, INMARSAT-C antenna X 1, NUC Light X\n2, green flash light X 1, and S-Band radar antenna X 1.\nAll above listed damages were shown by the officer on duty to your\nforeman. Urgent repairs of these damaged places are required, please take\nthe matter up with operator to hold him responsible for the damage\nsustained, which will be repaired immediately at this port.\nThe account for this repair and time loss will be forwarded to you in due\ncourse from our head office.\nWe thank you in advance for your kindly attention to this matter.\nYours faithfully,\nSigned by: (Master’s signature)\nReceived by: (Stevedore’s representative’s signature)"
