    "text": "CLAIM LETTER-Sample 4\nTo: Master and Owners of “AAA”, IMO No. __________\nFrom: Master of the vessel of BBB, IMO No. __________\nSubject:_______(incident) between vessel AAA and vessel BBB\nDate:__________ ; Port or Location:__________\n「事故概述 Incident description」WHXXX alongside at berth:20F at XXXX port,\nWhen Your vessel turned at my vessel port bow, and you last barge collided my vessel,\nmade my vessel’s hull dent about: 50CM x 20CM, depth:2CM, at frame:57-58.\nWith reference to the subject _______(incident) between your vessel AAA and\nour vessel BBB under my command at _______(name of port or location at\nsea) on ________(date).\nI on behalf of Owners of BBB hold you/Owners of AAA fully responsible for all\ndamage/loss directly or indirectly caused to my vessel as a result of the\n_______(incident).\nOur Owners will seek satisfactory security from you/Owners of AAA:\na. [損失無法確定選此]when we have more information as to extent of\ndamage/loss\nor\nb. [損失已確定選此]in the sum of USD xxxxxxxx with breakdown as\nfollow :\nThe damage/loss listed/shown in this Claim Letter reflects visual damage/loss\npresently found on this occasion and we reserve our right to claim any additional\ndamage/loss arising out of the subject incident which becomes patent or are\ndiscovered at a late date.\nI would also propose that our agent/Owners arrange a survey of the damage\nsustained and be contacted with you/Owners soonest possible\nYour Faithfully\nOn behalf of Owners of vessel BBB Liability for confirmed & receipt\nby vessel AAA\nSignature:____________________\nPrint Signature:____________________\nname:______________________ Master of “AAA”:\nMaster of “BBB”"
